<subpara id="X39400000RP01SC_15" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DBP00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>The accelerator position sensor is installed on the accelerator pedal rod assembly. The accelerator position sensor has a 2-system internal structure with different output characteristics, and converts the accelerator opening angle (accelerator pedal depression amount) into a linear voltage signal of approximately 0-5V, which it outputs to the engine control computer.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A152915J05" width="7.106578999in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
