</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), operate according to the screen display and select [ECU Data Monitor].</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Read [Accelerator Sensor No.1 Voltage] and [Accelerator Sensor No.2 Voltage] displayed on SST (TaSCAN).</ptxt>
